// with its cast time and cooldown as the 1.12.1 client's Spell.dbc holds them (seconds: the cast
// from SpellCastTimes.dbc, 0 for an instant or a channel; the cooldown the longer of the spell's
// own and its category's), and where it is aimed; a channelled spell (Blizzard) also its channel time,
// its ticks' interval (seconds) and its radius (yards), from SpellDuration.dbc, its periodic
// amplitude and SpellRadius.dbc. The ranks are the top ones a level-60 player
// casts. `cargo run -p esurv-content --features client --example check_assist_spells` checks them
// against the client and prints a row for any id given to it.
